stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Normal
  Normal --> Frozen: authorized emergency freeze
  Frozen --> BlockNewExecution: execution fails closed
  Frozen --> Inspect: preserve cases / grants / execution evidence
  Inspect --> RollbackEligible: separately authorized + no divergence
  RollbackEligible --> RolledBack
  Inspect --> CorrectiveGate: unsafe or divergent state
  Frozen --> Normal: authorized release after validation
  RolledBack --> Normal: validated recovery
